# Everything below defines Py_LIMITED_API, which Py_BUILD_CORE forbids, so none
# of them can be a builtin -- CPython's own static Modules/Setup keeps xxlimited
# commented out for the same reason. Left enabled they are built as .so and
# cannot link against a static libpython. _ctypes_test is disabled for a
# different reason: it exists only to be dlopened by test_ctypes through CDLL,
# and the test_ctypes entries in tests.toml already expect it to be absent.
*disabled*
